{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2031","title":"GRAMMY-NOMINEE MAHALIA’S LATEST MUSIC VIDEO SHOT ENTIRELY ON MI 11 SERIES","desc":"Captured with the The Star Performer Mi 11i, the video is a real testament to the fact that creativity is available to anyone.","view_cnt":"1261","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1627547737","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/945_operatorx_operatorx_opx/29/07/2021/a8356c750993d73fdaa362248a8344aa.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003eGrammy-nominated British singer Mahalia filmed her newest single, “Whenever you’re ready” entirely on Xiaomi’s creator-focused Mi 11 Series, a real testament to the fact that creativity is available to anyone. Captured on a budget, the production team aptly chose the film-grade yet affordable Mi 11i smartphone, which is known for flagship-rivaling features – namely sporting a powerful Snapdragon 888 chipset and a 108MP triple-camera setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe production of Mahalia’s music video from front-to-end was documented in a behind the scenes film that offers an intimate glimpse at Mahalia’s creative process, and a look into just how a smartphone as accessible as Mi 11i was able to pull off visualizing a Grammy Award nominee’s comeback single.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“Shooting an entire music video on a phone sounded like a crazy idea at first, but the moment I got to set I was blown away by the Xiaomi quality and I’m so happy with the outcome!” said Mahalia.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ciframe class=\"ql-video ql-align-center\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q1wGjVxwZ2M?showinfo=0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe behind-the-scenes film also kicks off Xiaomi’s new video series called “Focus” that will give stage to young up-and-coming artists and video creators from all over the world and will focus on their vision and journey within the context of shooting world-class videos on smartphones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMahalia’s music video is directed by Alex Motlhabane of the British director duo The Rest, who has previously worked with global stars like A$AP Rocky, Slowthai, Skepta and others. Pieter Snyman, who has also served as DOP on numerous international projects, took charge of camera work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"131","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1627547743"},"common":null}